{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22362","headline":"感逝寄远 · 白居易","name":"感逝寄远","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨日闻甲死，今朝闻乙死。\n知识三分中，二分化爲鬼。\n逝者不复见，悲哉长已矣。\n存者今如何，去我皆万里。\n平生知心者，屈指能有几。\n通果澧凤州，眇然四君子。\n相思俱老大，浮世如流水。\n应叹旧交游，凋零日如此。\n何当一杯酒，开眼笑相视。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}